    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Secluded Library</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Channel Energy</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> You may force creatures to make a Fortitude save to resist the effects of your channel energy rather than a Will save. Undead are not immune to channeled energy that allows a Fortitude save.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/channeling-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
